<title>UK: INSIGHT-Coffee seen edging up, but charts dull.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Coffee seen edging up, but charts dull.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEPT	Close  * Support * Resist * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA40</p>
<p> COFFEE    1,825  *  1,800  *  1,850 *   47  *  1,802 *  1,953</p>
<p>---------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - JULY 10----------------</p>
<p>LIFFE coffee futures could edge higher to extend overnight's gains with second-position September challenging the immediate $1,850 barrier, technical analysts said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The market is due to open $30 higher on the back of New York's advance on Wednesday for the second straight day, traders said.</p>
